4. Facilities.html

<html><body background="" font="times new roman" align="center"><font color="blue"><h1><b>KATHIR COLLEGE OF ARTS AND SCIENCE</b></h1><h3>Neelambur,Coimbatore-19</h3><h2><font color="red">Facilities</font></h2><pre><u><font color="skyblue"><h3>Hostel</h3></font></u>* Separate hostels for men and women with indoor and outdoor games.* Congenial atmosphere for the students to engage themselves in their studies.* Kitchen, which ensures hygienic and healthy food.<u><font color="skyblue"><h3>Library</h3></font></u>The College has a knowledge packed library. Every year, information on various subjects is updated by the addition of latest publications including professional journals and magazines. The Library of the college covers an area of 1680 sq.ft. and houses more than 8,000 books and over 15 National and International journals and magazines. It can accommodate hundred students at a time. Back volumes of journals and university question papers for reference.<u><font color="skyblue"><h3>English Language Lab</h3></font></u>An Innovative and effective method for developing listening and speaking skills in English is available in the Language Lab.<u><font color="skyblue"><h3>Transport</h3></font></u>College Bus facilities are provided for the students from Velliangadu via Karamadai, from Sirumugai via Alangombu and from Gandhipuram via Thudiyalur.<u><font color="skyblue"><h3>Placement Cell</h3></font></u>A seprate placement cell is functioning for providing job oppurtunities to the outgoing students in reputed companies.<u><font color="skyblue"><h3>National Service Scheme</h3></font></u>The College has been sanctioned four NSS Units by Bharathiar University, two units for women students and two units for men student. Various service oriented activities and special camps have been conducted sucessfully every year.<u><font color="skyblue"><h3>Youth Red Cross</h3></font></u>YRC is another organisation involving men students. Various Blood donation camps are conducted by YRC.<u><font color="skyblue"><h3>Sports and Games</h3></font></u>Sports and Games activities are organises from the begining of the year. Intramural tournaments are conducted in Cricket and Ball Badminton and indoor games such as Chess and Carrom, etc.</pre></font></body></html>

